Hi -- that suggests that whatever you have stored in "t" in the R terminal is a character object, not a tree. Do this, except with your newick file:

library(BioGeoBEARS)
tr = read.tree(file="your_newick_file.newick")
prt(tr)

Cheers!
Nick

